    "narrative": "The lineup for the Austin Waves today is headlined by **Kyle Tucker**, who commands an elite score of 85.90 against Tomoyuki Sugano. This is our clear priority play, driven by a massive park factor boost (+14%) and a favorable matchup against a pitcher with a 4.93 xERA. Alongside him, **Andy Pages** (74.43) and **Drake Baldwin** (71.20) provide significant value; **Andy Pages** benefits from the same high-run-environment park adjustment as **Kyle Tucker**, while **Drake Baldwin** finds himself in a premium leadoff spot facing a high-xERA arm in Bailey Ober, maximizing his opportunities to contribute to our Runs category.\n\nOur most difficult roster decision involved the marginal tier of hitters, specifically the choice to start **Dominic Smith** (58.93) over several other fringe options. **Dominic Smith** earned the nod over the likes of **Jackson Merrill** (53.97) and **Gunnar Henderson** (52.61) due to a stronger platoon advantage (+7%) and a solid matchup against Ober. While **Gunnar Henderson** and **Miguel Vargas** both offer high upside, they are fighting an uphill battle against Shane McClanahan and Shota Imanaga, respectively, which suppressed their scores despite their usual production. We continue to monitor the status of **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** and **Jordan Westburg** on the IL, while **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Heliot Ramos**, **Nasim Nunez**, **Josh Jung**, **Curtis Mead**, **Wade Meckler**, and **Luis Lara** remain inactive as we prioritize the efficient utilization of our daily games-played cap.\n\nManagers should remain cautious regarding the \"Lineup Pending\" status for all starters. While the projections assume standard batting orders, any shifts in lineup construction\u2014particularly for **Liam Hicks** or **Coby Mayo**\u2014could necessitate a last-minute adjustment if they drop out of favorable run-producing slots. We are closely monitoring the weather and potential late-scratches, but as it stands, the combination of **Kyle Tucker**, **Andy Pages**, and **Drake Baldwin** provides the necessary floor and ceiling to remain competitive in our pursuit of Roto category points today.",
